{
  "about": "The GPT-Live SIP wire shapes the engine's transport (PhoneCalls.OpenAILive, its Sideband, Events and Controls) and the eval runners' simulated endpoint (benchmark/bin/evallib/phone_sim.py) must agree on. Read by apps/fermix_core/test/fermix_core/phone_calls/gpt_live_wire_contract_test.exs, which normalizes and classifies every exemplar, and by benchmark/bin/test_phone_sim.py, which holds everything the simulator sends and answers to these shapes. Change a shape here and both sides are tested against it. Every key, password and number is invented.",
